While I understand your perspective, I believe a purely practical approach risks overlooking the crucial foundation of theoretical knowledge.  

Medicine is built on a complex web of scientific principles.  Understanding these principles is essential for diagnosing diseases accurately, developing effective treatment plans, and staying abreast of advancements in medical research.  

